WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.436
Products are what your store sells.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:08.309
This video shows why a product's price lives with its content, how products,

00:00:08.309 --> 00:00:13.360
currencies and listing pages fit together, and how to use every product screen.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.935
Every store starts with the same question:

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:23.414
what do we sell, and for how much?

00:00:23.414 --> 00:00:29.860
Prices, pictures and descriptions kept in spreadsheets and scattered pages go out of date quickly.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:34.355
Goods, services and digital items each need a price.

00:00:34.355 --> 00:00:38.811
Some things you only list, such as homes or cars, and they need

00:00:38.811 --> 00:00:41.910
a price or an inquiry button, but no cart.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.100
The Products module keeps the price with the content.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.356
A product is an ordinary page of your site, with a price, pictures,

00:00:50.356 --> 00:00:52.280
and rules for how it sells.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:57.262
Shoppers get a shop page with filters and sorting, and the cart, the

00:00:57.262 --> 00:01:00.350
checkout and the orders all read the same price.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:08.812
A product is a content item whose type has the Product part.

00:01:08.812 --> 00:01:14.560
The part holds the price, the currency, a compare-at price, a sale price and a SKU.

00:01:15.310 --> 00:01:18.421
Commerce, Products lists every product.

00:01:18.421 --> 00:01:25.750
Commerce, Product Listings holds the pages that show products to shoppers, with filters and sorting.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.537
Commerce, Currencies holds the currencies you sell in.

00:01:30.537 --> 00:01:38.880
Extra features add variants, bundles, grouped products, comparison, recommendations, product feeds and search indexes.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:43.643
Which products can be bought online, and how a price is shown, is

00:01:43.643 --> 00:01:45.565
decided on the content type.

00:01:45.565 --> 00:01:47.770
A single product can override it.

00:01:51.988 --> 00:01:53.785
Open Commerce, Currencies.

00:01:53.785 --> 00:01:57.997
These are the currencies every product price can use, so add only the

00:01:57.997 --> 00:01:59.288
ones you sell in.

00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:01.301
Click Add Currency.

00:02:01.301 --> 00:02:05.770
Enter the Currency code, which is three letters such as CAD, and a

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:08.439
Display name such as Canadian Dollar.

00:02:08.892 --> 00:02:09.951
Click Save.

00:02:09.951 --> 00:02:13.313
The new currency is listed with Edit and Delete.

00:02:13.313 --> 00:02:19.042
Its code cannot change, but you can rename it, and every product editor now offers it.

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:25.232
Open Commerce, Products.

00:02:25.232 --> 00:02:28.446
Every product is listed here with its status.

00:02:28.446 --> 00:02:31.722
Use Search to find one, and Edit to change it.

00:02:32.234 --> 00:02:33.697
Click New Product.

00:02:33.697 --> 00:02:37.172
The Content tab holds everything about the product.

00:02:37.172 --> 00:02:38.391
Enter a Title.

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:43.084
Leave the Permalink empty, and it is made from the title when you save.

00:02:44.506 --> 00:02:47.338
Enter the Price and choose its currency.

00:02:47.338 --> 00:02:52.016
Leave Use the default currency to use the one set on the content type.

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:54.962
Compare-at price is the old price:

00:02:54.962 --> 00:02:59.569
when it is higher, the shop shows it struck through with the saving.

00:02:59.569 --> 00:03:03.491
Enter a SKU, and tick Featured to show the product first.

00:03:03.942 --> 00:03:09.142
Under Images, click Add media, open the products folder in the media library,

00:03:09.142 --> 00:03:11.272
tick a picture and click OK.

00:03:11.272 --> 00:03:17.162
Then write the Description, and enter the Weight, which weight-based shipping rates use.

00:03:18.616 --> 00:03:19.761
Click Publish.

00:03:19.761 --> 00:03:23.368
The product is on sale as soon as it is published, and it

00:03:23.368 --> 00:03:24.856
appears in the list.

00:03:29.035 --> 00:03:31.475
Open a product to set how it sells.

00:03:31.475 --> 00:03:37.130
A Sale price makes the product sell at that price, with the regular price struck through.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.975
Sale runs sets the dates.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:43.774
Quantities and volume pricing limits how many a buyer can add:

00:03:43.774 --> 00:03:46.394
At least, At most, and In packs of.

00:03:46.394 --> 00:03:50.610
Volume discounts give a percentage off each from a quantity.

00:03:51.061 --> 00:03:56.215
Role discounts give signed-in roles, such as wholesale buyers, a percentage off.

00:03:56.215 --> 00:04:00.591
A buyer gets the best of their role and volume discounts, not both.

00:04:01.056 --> 00:04:06.363
Under Personalization, Add-ons are the extras a buyer chooses on the product page,

00:04:06.363 --> 00:04:10.464
such as gift wrap or an engraving, each with a Label, an Extra

00:04:10.464 --> 00:04:12.816
price, and what it is Charged on.

00:04:13.326 --> 00:04:16.634
Sold elsewhere is for a product you only promote.

00:04:16.634 --> 00:04:21.506
Enter its address, and its card links there instead of showing Add to cart.

00:04:21.962 --> 00:04:24.929
Click Publish, then open the product on the shop.

00:04:24.929 --> 00:04:28.868
The page shows the sale price and the volume discount, and the gift

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:33.022
wrap add-on is offered, and the cart works the final price out for you.

00:04:37.211 --> 00:04:41.180
How products sell is set once on the content type.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:46.281
Open Content, Content Definition, Content Types, and edit Product.

00:04:46.738 --> 00:04:49.318
Click Edit next to the Product part.

00:04:49.318 --> 00:04:53.433
Product Type says whether it is a Good, a Service or Digital.

00:04:53.433 --> 00:04:57.488
Default currency is used by products that do not choose one.

00:04:57.942 --> 00:05:03.927
Sales mode decides whether products are Purchasable, Listing only, or chosen Per item.

00:05:03.927 --> 00:05:09.002
A listing only product is shown and filtered, but never added to a cart.

00:05:09.616 --> 00:05:15.222
Price display shows the price, shows a label such as Call for price, or hides it.

00:05:15.222 --> 00:05:20.636
An Inquiry button and an Inquiry link send interested visitors somewhere else.

00:05:21.091 --> 00:05:26.043
Add Parts offers Product prices, for several ways to buy one product, such

00:05:26.043 --> 00:05:30.501
as monthly and yearly, and Product variants, for sizes and colors.

00:05:34.718 --> 00:05:37.065
Open Commerce, Product Listings.

00:05:37.065 --> 00:05:39.103
The Shop page is a listing:

00:05:39.103 --> 00:05:41.759
an ordinary page that shows products.

00:05:41.759 --> 00:05:44.538
Edit it to change what shoppers can do.

00:05:44.994 --> 00:05:48.634
Products chooses every product type, or only some.

00:05:48.634 --> 00:05:54.354
Under Filters, Choose filters lets you pick the filters, and drag them into order.

00:05:54.815 --> 00:05:59.508
Sorting sets the sorts shoppers can choose, and the Default sort.

00:05:59.508 --> 00:06:04.465
Paging offers numbered pages, a Load more button, or Infinite scroll.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:09.516
Layout sets a grid or a list, the Image shape and the page sizes.

00:06:09.516 --> 00:06:15.370
Keyword search adds a search box, and a Search index can replace the database search.

00:06:15.859 --> 00:06:21.184
On the shop, shoppers filter by Featured or Price, sort, and switch between

00:06:21.184 --> 00:06:23.024
the grid and the list.

00:06:23.024 --> 00:06:26.179
Every combination has its own web address.

00:06:30.383 --> 00:06:33.988
Product Comparison adds a Compare tick box to every card.

00:06:33.988 --> 00:06:38.051
Shoppers tick up to four products, such as these three, and a bar

00:06:38.051 --> 00:06:41.713
at the bottom of the page counts the products they picked.

00:06:42.165 --> 00:06:46.150
Compare opens a page that sets the products side by side:

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:50.325
their prices, their stock, and a row for each specification.

00:06:50.775 --> 00:06:53.354
Open a product to see the other features.

00:06:53.354 --> 00:06:57.468
Products in this group puts several products on one page, such as the

00:06:57.468 --> 00:06:58.675
pieces of a set.

00:06:59.129 --> 00:07:03.103
Upsells are better or bigger choices shown as You may also like, and

00:07:03.103 --> 00:07:06.379
Cross-sells go with the product and appear in the cart.

00:07:06.842 --> 00:07:10.855
Under Bundle, Made of lists the products in a kit, sold at the

00:07:10.855 --> 00:07:14.572
bundle's own price, with stock worked out from its parts.

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:21.675
Open Settings, Commerce, Product feeds.

00:07:21.675 --> 00:07:26.987
It publishes your catalog to Google Merchant Center, Meta and TikTok, and as

00:07:26.987 --> 00:07:30.420
a spreadsheet, and it lists the feed addresses.

00:07:30.872 --> 00:07:35.211
The page says how many products the feed holds, and warns about any

00:07:35.211 --> 00:07:38.598
it would refuse, such as a product without a photo.

00:07:38.598 --> 00:07:43.352
You can set a Brand, a Condition, and a Feed key to keep the feed private.

00:07:43.805 --> 00:07:49.148
For a large catalog, turn on Product Search with Lucene, Elasticsearch or Azure

00:07:49.148 --> 00:07:52.039
AI Search under Configuration, Features.

00:07:52.039 --> 00:07:54.302
A listing does not use it yet:

00:07:54.302 --> 00:08:00.084
you also create the index under Search, Indexes, and choose that index on the listing.

00:08:00.084 --> 00:08:03.415
Then the listing ranks keyword matches with it.

00:08:07.615 --> 00:08:08.419
A shop:

00:08:08.419 --> 00:08:13.368
goods with pictures, SKUs and sale prices, shown on a listing with filters

00:08:13.368 --> 00:08:16.275
and sorting, and bought through the cart.

00:08:17.025 --> 00:08:18.981
Listings without a cart:

00:08:18.981 --> 00:08:23.413
homes or cars set to Listing only, with a hidden price or Call

00:08:23.413 --> 00:08:25.955
for price, and an inquiry button.

00:08:26.705 --> 00:08:27.724
Wholesale:

00:08:27.724 --> 00:08:33.835
a minimum quantity, packs, volume discounts, and a role discount for your trade customers.

00:08:34.585 --> 00:08:35.896
Gifts and kits:

00:08:35.896 --> 00:08:41.764
add-ons for engraving or wrapping, bundles for starter kits, and upsells and cross-sells

00:08:41.764 --> 00:08:43.325
to raise the order.

00:08:45.325 --> 00:08:49.774
Keep the price with the content, choose how each product sells, and let

00:08:49.774 --> 00:08:51.623
the shop page do the rest.

00:08:51.623 --> 00:08:53.125
Thanks for watching.

